ont-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp; 폐강, 합반과목 대상자의 경우 변경,정정신청기간에 여석없는강좌 각&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">3과목씩 가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2. 합반강좌의 경우 수강신청처리되어 있으며, 기존강좌와 시간이 겹치는지 반드시 확인하여 겹칠 경우 수강 정정</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt;\">3. 유의사항 :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">지도교수와 수강상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">승인을 받은 학생에 한하여 수강 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">추가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">가능</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
